        "tag": "What to expect",
        "heading": "Back on the road with a clear rear view.",
        "highlight": "clear rear view.",
        "text": "Geaux Auto Glass replaces back glass on all vehicle types: cars, SUVs and trucks, domestic and foreign, personal and commercial. Most rear windows are tempered glass, which breaks into small pieces instead of cracking, so a broken back glass is replaced rather than repaired. Many rear windows also carry defroster lines, and some an antenna. Tell us the year, make and model when you request a quote. Mobile service is free, or bring the vehicle to our shop in Lafayette or Kenner, the same day or the next day by appointment.",
